      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARMATREE JUDO (1) could not have been more impressive a few runs back in her solid 24.86 win at this track over 431m then has finished in the placings in both runs since. Hard to top on best recent times. ARMATREE PESTO (8) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from seven tries. Missed the frame latest (25.30) when fourth over 431m at this track in a Grade 4/5. Looks well placed here and among the chances. KIANDO PIPER (7) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, the latest scoring at this track over 340m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can measure up again. PANDA UNLEASHED (2) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
